              "type": "text",
              "text": "Anand had a taxable income of $278 639 and paid $104 568 in PAYG tax over the year. Find his tax liability or tax refund, if he needs to pay the Medicare levy. Use the supplied 2022–23 tax table and a Medicare levy of 2%. Round completed income-tax and Medicare-levy amounts to cents before combining them.",
